\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]\hspace{0.25cm}{\color{CoverGoldBright}\rule{1.8in}{0.4pt}}\hspace{0.25cm}\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\large\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 關於本書}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\large\color{CoverGoldBright} About This Book}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\begin{minipage}{5in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
$if(backcover)$
$backcover$
$else$
本書逐段研讀彌迦書全書七章，九篇、三卷。全書三次呼召「聽」，每次都先宣判、後給出盼望：神親自下來作見證，審判從首領與神的家起，君王從最小的伯利恆出來；神先陳說祂為百姓做了甚麼，才說祂所要的是甚麼；控告的神，最後成為為百姓辨屈的神，全書終於一問：「有何神像你？」

{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream}\lettrine[lines=3,findent=2pt,nindent=2pt]{\color{CoverGoldBright}A}{}\ chapter-by-chapter study of Micah in nine studies and three volumes. Three times the book summons its hearers, and each time judgment comes first and hope after: the LORD comes down to bear witness, a ruler comes out of the least of the clans, the One who brings the case becomes the One who pleads the cause, and the book ends on a question — who is a God like You?}
$endif$
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\small\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 三輪「聽」}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\small\color{CoverGoldBright} Three Summonses to Hear}

