第一輪 & 萬民哪，你們都要聽 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Hear, O peoples, all of you} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 1:2}\\[0.25em]
第二輪 & 雅各的首領，以色列家的官長啊，你們要聽 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Hear now, heads of Jacob} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 3:1}\\[0.25em]
第三輪 & 以色列人哪，當聽耶和華的話 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Hear now what the LORD is saying} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 6:1}\\
